        "text": "A complete post-training workflow uses these personas with a behavior contract and official procedure text to generate synthetic conversations, fine-tune Nemotron 3.5 Lightning with LoRA on NVIDIA NeMo, merge the adapter, and evaluate against a frozen test set.",
